  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Chọn hệ trục toạ độ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> như hình vẽ.<br>\n\t\t\tDo cổng có dạng là parabol nên có phương trình là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTheo bài ra, parabol đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có hệ phương trình\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>25</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>50</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\t\n\t\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>50</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDiện tích hình phẳng giới hạn bởi đường các đường <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>50</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là<br>\n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></munderover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>50</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>50</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>500</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDiện tích hình chữ nhật <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy số tiền cần dùng để mua hoa trang trí cổng là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>200</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>500</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>200</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>311</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>111</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (đồng)</mtext></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>63</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (trăm nghìn).</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/e5db4aa7970dcff14edf94776bceb89e4f5340b290c32a4d20509faa21273ba4.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
